      "title": "5999 → 2339 元：小米 MIX Flip 2 小折叠手机新低，骁龙 8 至尊版 + 双 VC 立体散热",
      "content": "<p data-vmark=\"96ed\">小米 MIX Flip 2 小折叠手机发布于 2025 年 6 月，搭载骁龙 8 至尊版处理器，12+256G 发售价为 5,999 元。</p><p data-vmark=\"2c92\">今日天猫旗舰店直降至 2,339 元破冰新低，需 88VIP 家电消费券。</p><ul class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p data-vmark=\"9223\">点击下方卡片领券后 → 点击<strong>宝贝右上角“<span class=\"font-color-red\">…</span>”</strong>→ 点击弹出页面<strong>右下角“<span class=\"font-color-orangered\">淘金币</span>”</strong>下单即可：</p></li></ul><dir><a contenteditable=\"false\" href=\"https://uland.taobao.com/coupon/edetail?traceId=213e044417940472789065946e0cbc&amp;srItem=1&amp;e=10w2QS3OWTGlhHvvyUNXZfh8CuWt5YH5OVuOuRD5gLJMmdsrkidbOWBzzpT26idJcD%2Bq6KkuZp%2F2%2FQW8GqQhgsT0e4HSob8r%2Ft0vIpaz96mkX6EsmGbwhpeCqR%2B4mLfCtyy0%2FuXIS%2BryMW3eIAWKRa6LeGhgJY%2B%2FxrWOm542iF3mhpDhiQUdsLa2rbOkYn7KuZOkSsBQRqOFgOJv7pZuxwJvhFCTE4y8tq9PiEi9ua7qC1ydbwJ6x%2Blxp4S%2BlOq9qbU66yYTUTnOb1nxo9CBhBKrVI2oKIxqODtzNAe2hDuU7Fk93RiafyJFIVtDFljS%2FtSg8Qm6zsbkzSRmDmoY7A%3D%3D&amp;union_lens=lensId:TAPI@1794047278@214142f8_1523_1a1b58cff90_04bc@01\" target=\"_blank\" data-wapurl=\"https://uland.taobao.com/coupon/edetail?traceId=213e046117940472794365373e0ca2&amp;srItem=1&amp;e=OYb93MU%2B2USlhHvvyUNXZfh8CuWt5YH5OVuOuRD5gLJMmdsrkidbOWBzzpT26idJDTW69JOdJM2gNX9%2F0%2B0JcMido7GTzf64aqiyVO3XVaJKuh3IMRhdOifaPJeDPsSbRSHvQe2jOLZ9pbNCYX0I%2BPP%2BWUTgK%2F%2B0MLEqssXue1hesdIkAueW%2F8vqsZB65vkAsYu7abtsHPGWxb%2F4IJHyBxHtR5M9fhgNqtAQtCmCpiKsqzdxr0x8hhK9jrF9aypMEY5gFPl8b2oTyK9VyDNBcSi5%2FD0oDBjIuZOkSsBQRqPx%2BGc9Ris%2BVOJ5ht1gV4buyjyXaa9C%2FJYCGruttYDvNg%3D%3D&amp;union_lens=lensId:TAPI@1794047279@210497fa_14ac_1a1b58d01a2_962f@01\" data-iosurl=\"https://uland.taobao.com/coupon/edetail?traceId=213e04ce17940472799112289e0c5f&amp;srItem=1&amp;e=ImaJv%2BfauUGlhHvvyUNXZfh8CuWt5YH5OVuOuRD5gLJMmdsrkidbOWBzzpT26idJ6KcLlqU2VjxCkSlf42muNHHVP2YX3t4rlEUGgOF5lxGkX6EsmGbwhpeCqR%2B4mLfCtyy0%2FuXIS%2BryMW3eIAWKRa6LeGhgJY%2B%2FngJ5VGYeiHAIDQ3JM9kseLa2rbOkYn7KuZOkSsBQRqOFgOJv7pZuxwJvhFCTE4y8tq9PiEi9ua4iF6LAnVo6NyeHGt4Jp1F9aTCDqbyAZhK9%2FQpCn8msKxKrVI2oKIxqODtzNAe2h